<title>USA: Powerwave prices stock offer.</title>
<headline>Powerwave prices stock offer.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Powerwave Technologies Inc Monday said its public offer of 3.25 million common shares has been declared effective by the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission at an offering price of $22.00 a share.</p>
<p>Powerwave is selling 750,000 shares and certain selling shareholders are selling 2,500,000 shares.</p>
<p>Net proceeds to Powerwave are expected to be about $15.2 million.</p>
</text>
